":"<p>Our gym floors are available in <strong>8mm<\/strong>, <strong>10mm<\/strong>, and <strong>12mm <\/strong>thicknesses to suit any level of activity. <\/p><p>Whether you're outfitting a small gym or a large training facility, our flooring offers unparalleled durability and versatility. <\/p><ul><li><strong>8mm:<\/strong> Ideal for <strong>home gym flooring<\/strong>, perfect for areas with lighter weights. <br\/><\/li><li><strong>10mm:<\/strong> Optimal for <strong>commercial gym flooring<\/strong>, designed to withstand heavy weight drops. <br\/><\/li><li><strong>12mm:<\/strong> The best choice for <strong>professional gym and sports facilities<\/strong>. <br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Choose the perfect thickness for your fitness needs and experience the advantage today.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.rich_text_heading_1.value }}"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.rich_text_text_1.value }}<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"328c4c0d-b22e-4a15-b3fe-0599c9f89681":{"type":"logo-list","blocks":{"template--14491778023553__328c4c0d-b22e-4a15-b3fe-0599c9f89681-16856368552b0dcea8-0":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/antimicrobial.png","link":""}},"template--14491778023553__328c4c0d-b22e-4a15-b3fe-0599c9f89681-16856368552b0dcea8-1":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"ima